WEBVTT

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:05.720
Banagher Links, Unicorn Gundam,
taking off!

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:08.930
The final pointlocation
indicated by the La+ Program

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.090
is Industrial 7's Magallanica.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:15.180
Banagher's path is blocked
by the Banshee Norn,

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.630
piloted by Riddhe Marcenas.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.340
They intend to incinerate everything?

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:22.800
The Foundation doesn't care about
preserving the Box anymore.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:26.840
Before they see it handed over
to a third party, they'd rather- -

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.880
We don't have time for this!
Frontal will- -

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:34.840
Riddhe, who has been swallowed by the
machine, stands in Banagher's way.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.260
To help Banagher, the injured Marida
boards the Kshatriya.

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:41.720
Marida, you heard the plan.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.010
Are you up for it?

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:45.090
Yes.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:46.260
Thank you.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:50.260
Kshatriya! Launching!

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:28.260
(ANOTHER COSMIC GLOW)

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:43.970
Enemy mobile suit on catapult four!
It's latched on!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.260
Dislodge it ASAP!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:01.550
Banagher!

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.090
Unicorn Gundam, please
come in for resupply!

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:07.130
I'm still good!

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:27.760
We can do this!

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:29.430
Force your way through!

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:30.800
Where is he?

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:33.970
Is that him?!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.800
You're shooting your own allies?!

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:36.680
They're warmongers who wrecked the
world while pretending to be loyal!

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:39.300
They're all a filthy blight!

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:05.510
What's that?

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.630
The psycommu is being jammed!

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:19.590
From the moment we met,
I couldn't stand you.

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:25.090
Now die, you bastard!

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.800
What's happening out there?

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:34.130
Are you observing this on your end?

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:38.630
Those funnel-like objects might be
emitting some sort of jamming signal.

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:42.430
Even the psycho-waves that control
the psycommu are a type of wave,

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:44.470
so if they slam into
even more powerful waves,

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:46.380
it should be possible to negate them.

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:48.760
The Unicorn should be
able to shake it off.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.380
But if their psycommu systems
are pulling at each other,

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.010
not even the Unicorn's...

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.630
Ensign. Ensign Riddhe.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.840
Ensign Riddhe!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:05.220
I believe your heart knows
what you must do right now.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.010
Help Banagher...

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:46.300
This is just an illusion...

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:48.840
The psycommu is picking up
random thoughts!

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.340
The machine only amplifies
what is already there.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:54.050
- Even your Banshee is
- It has a system that

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:57.470
- a beast of possibility.
- reacts to the human heart!

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.880
The human heart?
I'm sensing their hearts...?

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:01.840
Alberto!

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.010
Ensign Riddhe!

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:04.510
Stop, Mr. Ensign!

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:07.300
Come back to your real self,
Ensign Riddhe!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:09.680
Don't hurt yourself more than you have!

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:37.840
- Don't hurt yourself...
- Come back to your real self...

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:38.970
They...

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:44.300
They're all... saying I'm wrong?!

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:47.340
Riddhe!

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:52.380
Mineva... You, too?

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:57.220
Even though I asked you
not to leave me...

00:08:58.220 --> 00:08:59.180
Don't!

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:30.630
The psycho-waves are off the charts...?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:41.630
Your heart is so overly earnest
it hurts others and yourself.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:47.050
Calm down and take a look
around you. The world is vast.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:50.380
It's full of so many people,
all resonating with each other.

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:54.630
W-Wait!

00:09:58.430 --> 00:09:59.340
I...

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:04.590
What have... What have I done?

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:20.550
Something... is targeting...

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.050
Marida...

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:25.510
...this sector?

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:27.470
You heard that?

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:30.930
Yeah. She said to be careful.

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:33.970
What was that?

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:35.930
That voice...

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:38.430
That's not the light of
an explosion! What is it?

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:45.630
It's so like you.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:51.510
At the very end, that's what
you came to tell me?

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:57.300
You were my light.

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:01.630
You were the light that
gave me a second life.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:10.430
Thank you... Father.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:24.010
Princess. Marida Cruz, standing down.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:26.680
Marida, I'm sorry.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:28.590
I couldn't repay...

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:36.630
Princess, hold on tight to Banagher.

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.800
If you don't, he might...

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:02.260
Mere shields have that kind of power?

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:09.220
I won't lose out to the likes of you!

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.630
Why you?

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:46.970
Why does he need you, someone who
doesn't even want his attention?

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:49.720
Don't look at me!
I don't want to see you!

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:54.130
C-Captain!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.470
Captain...

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:37.010
Luminous phenomenon fading.

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:38.600
Find out what caused it!

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:41.640
There's no change in
the target's position, right?

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.560
Marida...

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.810
William 001, 002 are in position!

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:03.180
Laser link established.
Analysis visual feed coming in!

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.470
Two Endra-class,
one Musaka-class detected!

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:09.680
Targeting error is within range
of +/- 0.5! We are good to fire!

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:12.930
Friendly machines retreating!
Line of fire is clear!

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.680
Hyper mega particle cannon...

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.600
...FIRE!

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:31.890
One Endra-class,
one Musaka destroyed!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.680
Moderate damage to
surviving Endra-class!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:34.890
No return fire?

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:37.510
Endra appears to be retreating
along with its escorts!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:57.140
That was no hallucination.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.970
I heard her, plain as day.

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:15.970
- I couldn't do anything for you...
- Just having you near me made me happy...

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:20.510
- Even though you were my light...
- That's all I ever...

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.510
Unicorn...

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:28.640
This is a Newtype resonance...?

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:36.600
Banagher, shoot me...

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:38.510
Please, shoot me!

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:18.760
Observational assessment. Nahel Argama
has breached Neo Zeon line.

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:21.760
It's almost time.

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:29.600
- Begin firing preparations.
- It's still too soon.

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.430
The Box has no meaning
in and of itself.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:37.600
We could wait and see what
they intend to do with it.

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:49.260
On my authority as
Londo Bell commander,

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:52.720
we will conduct a search inside
the Cheyenne Base facility.

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:16.810
Don't overdo it.

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:18.760
Back at you, Commander.

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.850
This is our only chance
to show our stuff.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.510
Whatever happens, stay calm
and cope with it.

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:23.970
Banagher.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:28.260
Don't forget that we're here
to back you up.

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:29.260
Right.

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:33.140
You didn't have to come, too.

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:36.260
I also have a right
to see this through.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:38.100
Or rather, a duty to.

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.220
Too many people have died.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:46.140
If Laplace's Box isn't worth
all that loss of life, I...

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:50.100
Whatever it is,

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:53.100
whatever is about to happen,

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.510
promise me.

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:58.350
Promise that you will come back to me.

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:21.600
"My only desire..."

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:29.640
Mr. Conroy. We're heading for
that mansion. For the Vist residence.

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:33.140
Motion detected inside habitat.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.100
No change in Magallanica.

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:39.010
Command module seems to be deserted.

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:41.600
No readings from harbor center, either.

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:43.930
Communications appear to be cut off.

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:46.850
Done at the behest of
Magallanica's lord,

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:49.600
the master of the
Vist Foundation, no doubt.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:53.180
Should we go inside, too?

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:54.390
Captain?

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:57.060
The Nahel Argama's at her limit.

00:19:57.100 --> 00:20:01.390
If we seal the gate behind us,
we can use Magallanica as a shelter.

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:03.220
Just a moment.

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.720
I've inspected the state
of your repairs.

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:09.390
If this were a Zeon ship, they would be
enough for her to fight another battle.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.140
Lt. Zinnerman...

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:13.220
The Rewloola is still out there.

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:15.890
We don't know how Full Frontal
will come at us.

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:20.470
Plus, I'm also worried about why the
General Revil hasn't turned up yet.

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:24.260
You should keep the ship on standby
outside to respond to- -

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:26.760
Something is targeting us.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:31.140
That's what Lt. Marida said.

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:40.350
Let's wait for the Unicorn.

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:44.810
This time, it's the turn of
us adults to protect him.

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:54.640
Wha- -?

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:57.640
- Magallanica's rotation, it's...!
- What?!

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:06.470
Banagher, respond!

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:10.470
Magallanica's rotation is stopping!
What's your status?!

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.470
Mr. Conroy!

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:16.220
Let's hurry.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.010
It's in here.

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:41.060
I've been waiting.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:45.810
So that I could tell you
only one thing.

00:21:53.260 --> 00:21:58.260
The offspring of my bloodline
and the princess of Zeon.

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:01.890
There could be no-one

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:05.470
more fitting to entrust Laplace's Box to.

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:41.560
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:43.470
LAPLACE'S BOX

00:23:45.220 --> 00:23:48.510
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
